            "sid": "AMO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwinj lembe maeni, wu dhiang’ mi Bacan, ma ni wi got mi Samaria, m’usendo jucan, m’unyono jucanpiny, m’uwacu ni rwodhigi kumae, Wukel, man wek wamadhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Yehova kwong’o ku leng’ pare, nia, nen, nindo bibino i wiwu, ya gibiyakuwu ku gol, man dongwu m’udong’ ku gol mi rec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wubiwok woko ku ka m’umor, ku ba dhanu ng’atuman atira i wang’e; man wubibeiru i Harmon, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubin ba Beth-el, man wudubi; ba Gilgal, man wumed dubo; man wukel lam mu ku ba rupiny ku ba rupiny, man apaje ma ku ba ceng’ adek ku ba ceng’ adek; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wuthier lam mi foc mi gin ma ie ju thobi, man wuyer pi lam mi berocwiny man wurwei pigi: kum maeni nyayu mutoro i iwu, E nyithindho mir Israel, Rwoth Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An bende amio iwu leng’ mi lak i adhura mu ceke, ku can kwen i kakewu ceke; ento wulokru ngo i bang’a, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man acero koth bende iwu, ma fodi dwi mi mwoka dong’ adek; man aketho koth ucwi wi adhura acel, e acere ku cwi wi adhura mange: koth ucwi wi ng’et ng’om acel, e ng’et ng’om ma koth ucwi ngo i wie ener. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno adhura ario kadi adek gicidho bang’ adhura acel kara gimadh pi, e eromogi ngo: ento wudwogo ngo i bang’a, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agoyowu ku motho man laimo: ukoko camu udul pothi mu man podho mir ulok mu ku yendubolo mu man yendulam mu: ento wudwogo ngo i bang’a, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aoro thong’om i kindwu calu mi Misiri: anego awobi mu ku palamularu, man ayaku riuni mu; man aketho ng’wic piny ma rac mi kagonjo mu idho malu cil i odiumwu: ento wudwogo ngo i bang’a, Yehova wacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang’ielo adhura i kindwu, calu kinde ma Mungu ng’ielo Sodom ku Gomora, e wubedo calu dhumac ma juyudho kud i mac: ento wudwogo i bang’a ngo, Yehova wacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
